# FixLens Android configuration (root-level reference).
#
# IMPORTANT: the Android app does NOT read this file. It exists only as
# documentation of where configuration lives in this project.
#
# Backend AI keys (NEVER in the Android app — server-side only):
#   backend/.env   (see backend/.env.example)
#
# Android device configuration (per device/AVD, never compiled in):
#   files/fixlens.properties on the device, containing:
#     backend.url=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#     revenuecat.api_key=testn_YOUR_TEST_STORE_KEY   (Test Store, development)
#   See docs/DEVICE_SETUP.md for the exact setup commands.
#
# NEVER commit any filled-in credentials file.
